# Guard film: the termite king walking slowly (the loose tripod, five feet down at times) and at his normal pace, seen
# from the side: his feet must stay put on the ground while the body passes over them (docs/plans/termite-walks.md).
cmd time set noon
cmd weather clear
lens 30
walker termite_king -9.5 -60 0.5 -90
log king
cmd tick freeze
fov 10
follow 0 0.15 -6 0 0
go -3 -60 0 0.4
burst slow 50 1
go 4 -60 0 1.0
burst normal 30 1
log off
follow off
quit
